abstract: >
  TrafficLens is an intelligent analytics platform that provides
  automated visitor classification, behavioral fingerprinting,
  real-time anomaly detection, and conversion optimization.
  It distinguishes between humans, AI agents, and bots with 92.7%
  accuracy, identifies traffic spikes and fraud patterns, and
  generates AI-powered insights with evidence-backed recommendations.
  The platform features a privacy-first design with GDPR-compliant
  tracking and includes comprehensive visualization dashboards.
